or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2026 the middle ran 59% of normal in January to February and 60% in June to July. Grid 34555 had its driest year in 1952 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
